{
 "comment": "Released versions of ctm-checkers and what each is: the sha256 of its contents (the wheel's RECORD, which lists every file with its hash), of the wheel file and of the page script ctm-checkers.js; from 0.2.0 the same for the STACK engine's wheel and ctm-checkers-stack.js (`stack`). A release never changes: tools/build.py --check fails when the code, the wheel or the script of a released version differ from its entry, and a development version must be above every release. Without tags (step-2 design \u00a713), this keeps a version and its HTML dependency path (site_libs/quarto-contrib/ctm-checkers-<version>/) for one content only, so browsers cannot keep a stale copy. The release PR adds its entry with `python tools/build.py --release`; the first change after it sets the next development version (X.Y.Z.devN, dependency version X.Y.Z.devN+<sha8 of the wheel>).",
